Below are representative benchmarks performed on a modern Intel Core i7-12700K (3.6 GHz base), 32 GB RAM, Ubuntu 22.04, compiled with **GCC 12.2, `-O3 -march=native`**. Each reported time is the median of 5 runs.

### Benchmark Setup

